{
  "uid": "sipeg-availability",
  "title": "SIPEG · Availability",
  "description": "Disponibilidad observada de los probes internos y públicos, estado de JWKS y Grafana, códigos HTTP, duración por fase, vencimiento TLS y cobertura de muestras. Los probes se ejecutan desde el VPS: una caída total del host también detiene Prometheus, Grafana y las notificaciones.",
  "tags": ["sipeg", "prometheus", "availability", "blackbox"],
  "editable": false,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "timezone": "utc",
  "schemaVersion": 42,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-6h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "timepicker": {
    "refresh_intervals": ["10s", "30s", "1m", "5m", "15m"]
  },
  "links": [
    {
      "asDropdown": false,
      "icon": "external link",
      "includeVars": true,
      "keepTime": true,
      "tags": [],
      "targetBlank": false,
      "title": "Operations",
      "tooltip": "Resumen operativo, estado de jobs y recursos críticos",
      "type": "link",
      "url": "/d/sipeg-operations-overview"
    },
    {
      "asDropdown": false,
      "icon": "external link",
      "includeVars": true,
      "keepTime": true,
      "tags": [],
      "targetBlank": false,
      "title": "API HTTP",
      "tooltip": "Tráfico, errores y latencia de las operaciones de negocio",
      "type": "link",
      "url": "/d/sipeg-api-http"
    },
    {
      "asDropdown": false,
      "icon": "external link",
      "includeVars": true,
      "keepTime": true,
      "tags": [],
      "targetBlank": false,
      "title": "VPS Overview",
      "tooltip": "Recursos, red y estado de recolección del host",
      "type": "link",
      "url": "/d/sipeg-vps-overview"
    }
  ],
  "templating": {
    "list": []
  },
  "annotations": {
    "list": [
      {
        "builtIn": 1,
        "datasource": { "type": "grafana", "uid": "-- Grafana --" },
        "enable": true,
        "hide": true,
        "iconColor": "rgba(0, 211, 255, 1)",
        "name": "Annotations & Alerts",
        "type": "dashboard"
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Estado actual por probe",
      "description": "Última muestra de `probe_success` para cada comprobación. Una fila ausente significa que no hay muestra de ese probe, no que esté correcto; contrastar con la salud de los jobs de Blackbox.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0,
          "color": { "mode": "thresholds" },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "red", "value": null },
              { "color": "green", "value": 1 }
            ]
          },
          "mappings": []
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byType", "options": "number" },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "mappings",
                "value": [
                  {
                    "type": "value",
                    "options": {
                      "0": { "text": "Fallo", "color": "red", "index": 0 },
                      "1": { "text": "Correcto", "color": "green", "index": 1 }
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              { "id": "custom.cellOptions", "value": { "type": "color-background" } },
              { "id": "custom.align", "value": "center" }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true,
        "cellHeight": "sm",
        "footer": { "show": false }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "probe_success{job=~\"blackbox-internal|blackbox-public\"}",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "format": "table",
          "legendFormat": "{{route}} · {{check}}"
        }
      ],
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": {
              "Time": true,
              "__name__": true,
              "instance": true,
              "job": true,
              "module": true
            },
            "renameByName": {
              "route": "Ruta",
              "check": "Comprobación",
              "Value": "Estado"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "bargauge",
      "title": "Disponibilidad observada",
      "description": "Porcentaje calculado sobre las muestras realmente recibidas en el rango. Es disponibilidad observada, no disponibilidad teórica: los huecos de recolección reducen la cobertura y no se rellenan con cero.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 0 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "decimals": 2,
          "min": 0,
          "max": 100,
          "color": { "mode": "thresholds" },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "red", "value": null },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 95 },
              { "color": "green", "value": 99 }
            ]
          },
          "mappings": []
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "displayMode": "gradient",
        "legend": {
          "calcs": [],
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": false
        },
        "maxVizHeight": 300,
        "minVizHeight": 16,
        "minVizWidth": 8,
        "namePlacement": "auto",
        "orientation": "horizontal",
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "showUnfilled": true,
        "sizing": "auto",
        "valueMode": "color"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "100 * avg_over_time(probe_success{job=~\"blackbox-internal|blackbox-public\"}[$__range])",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "legendFormat": "{{route}} · {{check}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Cobertura de muestras",
      "description": "Número de muestras recibidas por probe en el rango. Con scrape cada 30 s se esperan unas 720 muestras en 6 h. Menos muestras indican huecos de recolección, no un probe correcto.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 8 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0,
          "min": 0,
          "color": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "text" },
          "mappings": []
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true,
        "cellHeight": "sm",
        "footer": { "show": false }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "count_over_time(probe_success{job=~\"blackbox-internal|blackbox-public\"}[$__range])",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "format": "table",
          "legendFormat": "{{route}} · {{check}}"
        }
      ],
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": {
              "Time": true,
              "__name__": true,
              "instance": true,
              "job": true,
              "module": true
            },
            "renameByName": {
              "route": "Ruta",
              "check": "Comprobación",
              "Value": "Muestras"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Comparación interno vs público",
      "description": "Peor valor de `probe_success` en el rango por ruta y comprobación. Un 1 en `internal` junto a un 0 en `public` apunta al borde o al túnel, no a la API; un 0 en ambos apunta al origen.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 8 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0,
          "min": 0,
          "max": 1,
          "color": { "mode": "thresholds" },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "red", "value": null },
              { "color": "green", "value": 1 }
            ]
          },
          "mappings": []
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byType", "options": "number" },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "mappings",
                "value": [
                  {
                    "type": "value",
                    "options": {
                      "0": { "text": "Fallo", "color": "red", "index": 0 },
                      "1": { "text": "Correcto", "color": "green", "index": 1 }
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              { "id": "custom.cellOptions", "value": { "type": "color-background" } },
              { "id": "custom.align", "value": "center" }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true,
        "cellHeight": "sm",
        "footer": { "show": false }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "min by (route, check) (min_over_time(probe_success{job=~\"blackbox-internal|blackbox-public\"}[$__range]))",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "format": "table",
          "legendFormat": "{{route}} · {{check}}"
        }
      ],
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": {
              "Time": true,
              "__name__": true,
              "instance": true,
              "job": true,
              "module": true
            },
            "renameByName": {
              "route": "Ruta",
              "check": "Comprobación",
              "Value": "Peor estado"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Códigos HTTP de los probes",
      "description": "Código HTTP devuelto por cada probe. Un 0 significa que no hubo respuesta HTTP; un hueco significa que el probe no produjo muestra. El éxito final lo determina `probe_success`, no el código por sí solo.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 16 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0,
          "min": 0,
          "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" },
          "custom": {
            "axisBorderShow": false,
            "axisCenteredZero": false,
            "axisColorMode": "text",
            "axisLabel": "código",
            "axisPlacement": "auto",
            "barAlignment": 0,
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "gradientMode": "none",
            "hideFrom": { "legend": false, "tooltip": false, "viz": false },
            "insertNulls": false,
            "lineInterpolation": "stepAfter",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "pointSize": 5,
            "scaleDistribution": { "type": "linear" },
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false,
            "stacking": { "group": "A", "mode": "none" },
            "thresholdsStyle": { "mode": "off" }
          },
          "mappings": []
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "calcs": ["lastNotNull", "max"],
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": { "hideZeros": false, "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "probe_http_status_code{job=~\"blackbox-internal|blackbox-public\"}",
          "instant": false,
          "range": true,
          "legendFormat": "{{route}} · {{check}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Duración total del probe",
      "description": "Tiempo total de la comprobación, incluidos resolución, conexión, TLS, procesamiento y transferencia. Un valor cercano al timeout de 5 s indica que el probe está a punto de fallar por lentitud.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 16 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "decimals": 3,
          "min": 0,
          "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" },
          "custom": {
            "axisBorderShow": false,
            "axisCenteredZero": false,
            "axisColorMode": "text",
            "axisLabel": "segundos",
            "axisPlacement": "auto",
            "barAlignment": 0,
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "gradientMode": "none",
            "hideFrom": { "legend": false, "tooltip": false, "viz": false },
            "insertNulls": false,
            "lineInterpolation": "linear",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "pointSize": 5,
            "scaleDistribution": { "type": "linear" },
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false,
            "stacking": { "group": "A", "mode": "none" },
            "thresholdsStyle": { "mode": "off" }
          },
          "mappings": []
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "calcs": ["lastNotNull", "max"],
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": { "hideZeros": false, "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "probe_duration_seconds{job=~\"blackbox-internal|blackbox-public\"}",
          "instant": false,
          "range": true,
          "legendFormat": "{{route}} · {{check}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Fases de la solicitud HTTP",
      "description": "Desglose de la duración por fase: resolución, conexión, TLS, procesamiento y transferencia. Permite separar un problema de DNS o de red de uno del origen.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 24 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "decimals": 3,
          "min": 0,
          "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" },
          "custom": {
            "axisBorderShow": false,
            "axisCenteredZero": false,
            "axisColorMode": "text",
            "axisLabel": "segundos",
            "axisPlacement": "auto",
            "barAlignment": 0,
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "gradientMode": "none",
            "hideFrom": { "legend": false, "tooltip": false, "viz": false },
            "insertNulls": false,
            "lineInterpolation": "linear",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "pointSize": 5,
            "scaleDistribution": { "type": "linear" },
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false,
            "stacking": { "group": "A", "mode": "none" },
            "thresholdsStyle": { "mode": "off" }
          },
          "mappings": []
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "calcs": ["lastNotNull", "max"],
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": { "hideZeros": false, "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "probe_http_duration_seconds{job=~\"blackbox-internal|blackbox-public\", phase=~\"resolve|connect|processing|transfer|tls\"}",
          "instant": false,
          "range": true,
          "legendFormat": "{{route}} · {{check}} · {{phase}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Certificado TLS público",
      "description": "Días restantes hasta el certificado TLS más próximo a vencer en los probes públicos. Menos de 14 días se marca en naranja y menos de 7 en rojo. Sin datos significa que no hay muestra TLS, no que el certificado sea válido.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 24 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "d",
          "decimals": 2,
          "color": { "mode": "thresholds" },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "red", "value": null },
              { "color": "orange", "value": 7 },
              { "color": "green", "value": 14 }
            ]
          },
          "mappings": []
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "min by (route) ((probe_ssl_earliest_cert_expiry{job=~\"blackbox-internal|blackbox-public\", route=\"public\"} - time()) / 86400)",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "legendFormat": "{{route}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Salud de Blackbox y sus jobs",
      "description": "`up` de los jobs que ejecutan los probes y del propio exporter. Un 0 indica que Prometheus no pudo recolectar ese job; una fila ausente indica que el job no está configurado o no existe, y no debe interpretarse como saludable.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 7, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 32 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0,
          "color": { "mode": "thresholds" },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "red", "value": null },
              { "color": "green", "value": 1 }
            ]
          },
          "mappings": []
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byType", "options": "number" },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "mappings",
                "value": [
                  {
                    "type": "value",
                    "options": {
                      "0": { "text": "Caído", "color": "red", "index": 0 },
                      "1": { "text": "Activo", "color": "green", "index": 1 }
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              { "id": "custom.cellOptions", "value": { "type": "color-background" } },
              { "id": "custom.align", "value": "center" }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true,
        "cellHeight": "sm",
        "footer": { "show": false }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "min by (job) (up{job=~\"blackbox|blackbox-internal|blackbox-public\"})",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "format": "table",
          "legendFormat": "{{job}}"
        }
      ],
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": {
              "Time": true,
              "__name__": true,
              "instance": true
            },
            "renameByName": {
              "job": "Job",
              "Value": "Estado"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Cobertura y límites de la medición",
      "description": "Alcance real de los probes y qué no puede detectar este dashboard.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 7, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 32 },
      "options": {
        "code": {
          "language": "plaintext",
          "showLineNumbers": false,
          "showMiniMap": false
        },
        "content": "- Los probes se ejecutan desde el VPS contra el origen interno y el borde público. No son una comprobación externa independiente.\n- Una caída total del VPS también detiene Prometheus, Grafana y las notificaciones: este dashboard no puede avisar de un apagón completo.\n- Un HTTP 200 con HTML de Cloudflare no es salud. Los módulos de Blackbox validan cuerpo JSON, `authJwksReachable` y presencia de claves en JWKS, y rechazan HTML.\n- Una fila ausente o un hueco en las gráficas significa que no hay muestras para ese probe; no equivale a éxito. La cobertura de muestras y la salud de los jobs permiten distinguirlo.\n- Un `probe_success=0` con código HTTP 200 indica que la respuesta no superó las validaciones de contenido, no que el servicio esté sano.",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "targets": []
    }
  ]
}
